# Lines 14-15: Format('%s', [X]) with exactly one argument must fire.
# Lines 16 (two specs), 17 (%d), 18 (two args), 19 (extra text) must not.
# Known FP shape: X is not a string (Variant, number) so Format does the
# conversion; rewriting to plain X then changes meaning or fails to compile.
useless-format 14
useless-format 15
!useless-format 16
!useless-format 17
!useless-format 18
!useless-format 19
